n␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀VÒ␀␀…¬␀␀´␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀‘<XbXbr␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀¨½␀␀Ñ␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀0Ó/Ó/œ␀␀␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀‚␀=€␀␀␀␀␀␀@“␀␀R␀R␀c␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀6␀=€␀␀␀␀␀␀B“␀␀T␀T␀c␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀È␀=€␀␀␀␀␀␀A“␀␀S␀S␀c␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀V=€␀␀␀␀␀␀0“␀␀œœc␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀U;€␀␀␀␀␀␀1“␀␀c␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀F␀␀=€␀␀␀␀␀␀;“␀␀·␀␀·␀␀c␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Öa=€␀␀␀␀␀␀8“␀␀]c]cc␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀ b=€␀␀␀␀␀␀9“␀␀^c^cc␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ş=€␀␀␀␀␀␀2“␀␀ğğc␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ò[=€␀␀␀␀␀␀6“␀␀8^8^c␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0;1␀␀ë’␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀WÒ␀␀…¬␀␀´␀	Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀‘<XbXbr␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀—,¼␀	Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀=nnX)␀␀Æÿ␀␀!#␀mDÑ␀	Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀şEşEşEqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀]1vÔÿ1␀␀␀␀␀æ␀␀22n␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀i¬␀␀UÔÿ1␀␀␀␀␀¬␀␀t¯␀␀t¯␀␀V␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀ÄDÑ␀Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀ÅJ‚F‚FqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀ÏEÑ␀Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀¶KIIqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀È¬␀␀UÔÿ1␀␀␀␀␀ï±␀␀*­␀␀1­␀␀V␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀vEÑ␀Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀yMWHdHqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀{EÑ␀Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀|LlHmHqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀µ¹␀␀·␀Ôÿ1␀␀␀␀␀d­␀␀ªÈ␀␀«È␀␀ˆ)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0;1;2YÒ␀␀		SENIOR;0Y␀␀TRIGGER R030ISE_EI BEFORE INSERT ON R030ISE FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
  l_Valor VARCHAR2(2000);  
  l_Valido BOOLEAN;
  l_ProximaData DATE;
  l_EmpresaStr VARCHAR2(11);
  l_FilialStr VARCHAR2(11);
  l_Where VARCHAR2(50);
  l_temAud       BOOLEAN;
  l_codRPA       NUMBER(15);
  l_codSistema   NUMBER(2);
  l_codcpa       NUMBER(4);
  l_codtpa       NUMBER(4);
  l_datTemp      VARCHAR(10);  
BEGIN 
  /*e-Social -> S-1000 */ 
  l_Valor := '';
  l_ProximaData := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
  
  l_EmpresaStr := CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.NUMEMP);
  l_FilialStr := CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.CODFIL);

  l_Where := 'NUMEMP = ' ||  l_EmpresaStr || ' AND CODFIL = ' || l_FilialStr;    
  SP_PROXIMOHIST('DATALT', 'R030ISE', l_Where, :NEW.DATALT, l_ProximaData OUT);
    
  SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODFIL', :NEW.CODFIL, l_Valor OUT);
  SP_E_SOCIAL('S-1000', 'R030ISE', 'T', 'I', :NEW.DATALT, l_ProximaData, :NEW.NUMEMP, 0, 0, l_Valor, '', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 'R030ISE_EI');
  /*e-Social -> S-1000 */
  
  
  
  /* Geração de logs Certificado de Isenção*/ 
  l_codSistema := 1;  /* Código do sistema vetorh. */
  l_codcpa := 49;     /* Certificado de Isenção*/
  l_codtpa := 209;
 
  SP_EXISTE_LOG(l_codcpa, l_codtpa, l_codSistema, l_temAud OUT);   

    IF (l_temAud = TRUE) THEN
      SP_RET_REG_AUD(l_codrpa OUT);
      SP_INS_REG_AUD(l_codrpa, l_codSistema, l_codcpa, 1, l_codtpa, 1, 'R030ISE_SI', '');

      /* insere os campos chave  - Tabela R995PRC (Parâmetros da categoria) */
      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMEMP', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.NUMEMP));
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'CODFIL', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.CODFIL));
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATALT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATALT', l_datTemp);
      EXCEPTION
        WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R030ISE_SI: Erro ao inserir registros chave para a tabela de log de auditoria R995PRC.';
      END;

      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'CONCER', :NEW.CONCER);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMCER', :NEW.NUMCER);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATEMI, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATEMI', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATVEN, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATVEN', l_datTemp);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMPRO', :NEW.NUMPRO);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATPRO, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATPRO', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATPUB, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATPUB', l_datTemp);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'PAGPUB', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.PAGPUB));
      END;
  END IF;   
END␀ZÒ␀␀		SENIOR;0ı␀␀

TRIGGER R030ISE_EU BEFORE UPDATE ON R030ISE FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
  l_Valor VARCHAR2(2000);  
  l_Valido BOOLEAN;
  l_ProximaData DATE;
  l_AlterouRegistro BOOLEAN;
  l_EmpresaStr VARCHAR2(11);
  l_FilialStr VARCHAR2(11);
  l_Where VARCHAR2(50);
  l_temAud       BOOLEAN;
  l_codRPA       NUMBER(15);
  l_codSistema   NUMBER(2);
  l_codcpa       NUMBER(4);
  l_codtpa       NUMBER(4);
  l_datTemp      VARCHAR(10);  
BEGIN 
  /*e-Social -> S-1000 */ 
  l_Valor := '';
  l_ProximaData := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
  l_AlterouRegistro := FALSE;
	
  SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.CONCER, :NEW.CONCER, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;
  
  SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.NUMCER, :NEW.NUMCER, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;
  
  SP_VALUPDATE_DAT(:OLD.DATEMI, :NEW.DATEMI, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;
  
  SP_VALUPDATE_DAT(:OLD.DATVEN, :NEW.DATVEN, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;
  
  SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.NUMPRO, :NEW.NUMPRO, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;
  
  SP_VALUPDATE_DAT(:OLD.DATPRO, :NEW.DATPRO, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;
  
  SP_VALUPDATE_DAT(:OLD.DATPUB, :NEW.DATPUB, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;
  
  SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.PAGPUB, :NEW.PAGPUB, l_Valido OUT);
  IF (l_Valido = TRUE) THEN
    l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
  END IF;	
    
  IF (l_AlterouRegistro = TRUE) THEN	

    l_EmpresaStr := CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.NUMEMP);
    l_FilialStr := CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.CODFIL);

    l_Where := 'NUMEMP = ' ||  l_EmpresaStr || ' AND CODFIL = ' || l_FilialStr;    
    SP_PROXIMOHIST('DATALT', 'R030ISE', l_Where, :NEW.DATALT, l_ProximaData OUT);
  
    SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODFIL', :NEW.CODFIL, l_Valor OUT);
    SP_E_SOCIAL('S-1000', 'R030ISE', 'T', 'A', :NEW.DATALT, l_ProximaData, :NEW.NUMEMP, 0, 0, l_Valor, '', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 'R030ISE_EU');
  END IF;
  /*e-Social -> S-1000 */
  
  
  
  /* Geração de logs Certificado de Isenção*/ 
  l_codSistema := 1;  /* Código do sistema vetorh. */
  l_codcpa := 49;     /* Certificado de Isenção*/
  l_codtpa := 210;
 
  SP_EXISTE_LOG(l_codcpa, l_codtpa, l_codSistema, l_temAud OUT);   

  IF ((:OLD.NumEmp <> :NEW.NumEmp)
   OR (:OLD.CodFil <> :NEW.CodFil)
   OR (:OLD.DatAlt <> :NEW.DatAlt)
   OR (:OLD.ConCer <> :NEW.ConCer)
   OR (:OLD.NumCer <> :NEW.NumCer)
   OR (:OLD.DatEmi <> :NEW.DatEmi)
   OR (:OLD.DatVen <> :NEW.DatVen)
   OR (:OLD.NumPro <> :NEW.NumPro)
   OR (:OLD.DatPro <> :NEW.DatPro)
   OR (:OLD.DatPub <> :NEW.DatPub)
   OR (:OLD.PagPub <> :NEW.PagPub)) THEN

    IF (l_temAud = TRUE) THEN
      SP_RET_REG_AUD(l_codrpa OUT);
      SP_INS_REG_AUD(l_codrpa, l_codSistema, l_codcpa, 1, l_codtpa, 1, 'R030ISE_SU', '');

      /* insere os campos chave  - Tabela R995PRC (Parâmetros da categoria) */
      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMEMP', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.NUMEMP));
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'CODFIL', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.CODFIL));
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATALT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATALT', l_datTemp);
      EXCEPTION
        WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R030ISE_SU: Erro ao inserir registros chave para a tabela de log de auditoria R995PRC.';
      END;

      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDCONCER', :OLD.CONCER);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWCONCER', :NEW.CONCER);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDNUMCER', :OLD.NUMCER);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWNUMCER', :NEW.NUMCER);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATEMI, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDDATEMI', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATEMI, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWDATEMI', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATVEN, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDDATVEN', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATVEN, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWDATVEN', l_datTemp);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDNUMPRO', :OLD.NUMPRO);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWNUMPRO', :NEW.NUMPRO);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATPRO, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDDATPRO', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATPRO, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWDATPRO', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATPUB, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDDATPUB', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATPUB, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWDATPUB', l_datTemp);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDPAGPUB', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.PAGPUB));
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWPAGPUB', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :NEW.PAGPUB));
      END;
    END IF; 
  END IF;   
END␀XÒ␀␀		SENIOR;0W␀␀

TRIGGER R030ISE_ED BEFORE DELETE ON R030ISE FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
  l_Valor VARCHAR2(2000);  
  l_Valido BOOLEAN;
  l_ProximaData DATE;
  l_EmpresaStr VARCHAR2(11);
  l_FilialStr VARCHAR2(11);
  l_Where VARCHAR2(50);
  l_temAud       BOOLEAN;
  l_codRPA       NUMBER(15);
  l_codSistema   NUMBER(2);
  l_codcpa       NUMBER(4);
  l_codtpa       NUMBER(4);
  l_datTemp      VARCHAR(10);  
BEGIN 
  /*e-Social -> S-1000 */ 
  l_Valor := '';
  l_ProximaData := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
  
  l_EmpresaStr := CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.NUMEMP);
  l_FilialStr := CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.CODFIL);

  l_Where := 'NUMEMP = ' ||  l_EmpresaStr || ' AND CODFIL = ' || l_FilialStr;    
  SP_PROXIMOHIST('DATALT', 'R030ISE', l_Where, :OLD.DATALT, l_ProximaData OUT);

  SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODFIL', :OLD.CODFIL, l_Valor OUT);
  SP_E_SOCIAL('S-1000', 'R030ISE', 'T', 'E', :OLD.DATALT, l_ProximaData, :OLD.NUMEMP, 0, 0, l_Valor, '', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 'R030ISE_ED');
  /*e-Social -> S-1000 */
  
  
  
  /* Geração de logs Certificado de Isenção*/ 
  l_codSistema := 1;  /* Código do sistema vetorh. */
  l_codcpa := 49;     /* Certificado de Isenção*/
  l_codtpa := 209;
 
  SP_EXISTE_LOG(l_codcpa, l_codtpa, l_codSistema, l_temAud OUT);   

  IF (l_temAud = TRUE) THEN
      SP_RET_REG_AUD(l_codrpa OUT);
      SP_INS_REG_AUD(l_codrpa, l_codSistema, l_codcpa, 1, l_codtpa, 1, 'R030ISE_SD', '');

      /* insere os campos chave  - Tabela R995PRC (Parâmetros da categoria) */
      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMEMP', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.NUMEMP));
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'CODFIL', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.CODFIL));
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATALT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATALT', l_datTemp);
      EXCEPTION
        WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R030ISE_SD: Erro ao inserir registros chave para a tabela de log de auditoria R995PRC.';
      END;

      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'CONCER', :OLD.CONCER);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMCER', :OLD.NUMCER);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATEMI, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATEMI', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATVEN, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATVEN', l_datTemp);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMPRO', :OLD.NUMPRO);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATPRO, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATPRO', l_datTemp);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATPUB, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATPUB', l_datTemp);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'PAGPUB', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR, :OLD.PAGPUB));
      END;
  END IF;   
END␀␀␀Œ)␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀[Ò␀␀…¬␀␀´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀‘<XbXbr‡␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀—,¼␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀=nnX)␀␀Æÿ␀␀!#␀EÑ␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀ÙMZ”␀␀[”␀␀qC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀ôa´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀>«aÃbr‡␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀.␀t	␀␀␀␀␀␀Ş␀,␀1␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ˆÓ␀␀␀c¬␀␀Ì␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀e%só␀␀só␀␀w␀Æÿ␀␀…Ó␀␀␀µEÑ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÚM6␀6␀qC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀QÒ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀„„„ÿ␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0;1;2;3;4;5]Ò␀␀		SENIOR;0#␀␀TRIGGER R030LAU_EI BEFORE INSERT ON R030LAU FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	l_EsocialAtivo BOOLEAN;
	l_Json VARCHAR(2000);
	l_DataZero DATE;
	l_DatIniSST DATE;
	l_DataInicio DATE;
	l_DataTermino DATE;
BEGIN
	l_DataZero := DATETIME(31, 12, 1900, 0, 0, 0);
	
	SM_ESOCIAL_ATIVO(l_EsocialAtivo OUT);
	IF (l_EsocialAtivo = TRUE) THEN
		SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODFIL', :NEW.CodFil, l_Json OUT);
		
		l_DataInicio := :NEW.DatIni ;
		l_DataTermino := :NEW.DatTer;
		
		RH_RET_DATINISST(:NEW.NumEmp, l_DatIniSST OUT);
			
		IF (l_DatIniSST > l_DataZero AND (l_DataTermino > l_DatIniSST OR l_DataTermino = l_DataZero)) THEN				
		  	IF (l_DataInicio < l_DatIniSST) THEN
				l_DataInicio := l_DatIniSST;
			END IF;
			
			/* Cria pendência referente ao período do responsável */
			SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'I', l_DataInicio, l_DataTermino, :NEW.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, '', 0, NULL, l_DataInicio, 0, 'R030LAU_EI');
			
			/* Se tiver data de término informada, cria uma pendência para um dia após o término */
			IF (l_DataTermino > l_DataZero) THEN
				l_DataInicio := DATETIMEADD(DD, 1, l_DataTermino);
				l_DataTermino := l_DataZero;
			
				SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'I', l_DataInicio, l_DataTermino, :NEW.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, '', 0, NULL, l_DataInicio, 0, 'R030LAU_EI');
			END IF;
		END IF;
	END IF;
END␀^Ò␀␀		SENIOR;0’␀␀

TRIGGER R030LAU_EU BEFORE UPDATE ON R030LAU FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	l_EsocialAtivo BOOLEAN;
	l_AlterouCampo BOOLEAN;
	l_AlterouInicio BOOLEAN;
	l_AlterouTermino BOOLEAN;
	l_AlterouResponsavel BOOLEAN;
	l_DataInicio DATE;
	l_DataTermino DATE;
	l_DataInicio2 DATE;
	l_DataTermino2 DATE;
	l_Json VARCHAR(2000);
	l_DataZero DATE;
	l_DataMax DATE;
	l_DatIniSST DATE;
	l_JsonAlteracao VARCHAR2(2000);
BEGIN
	l_DataZero := DATETIME(31, 12, 1900, 0, 0, 0);
	l_DataMax := DATETIME(04, 06, 2080, 0, 0, 0);
	
	SM_ESOCIAL_ATIVO(l_EsocialAtivo OUT);
	IF (l_EsocialAtivo = TRUE) THEN
		SP_VALUPDATE_DAT(:OLD.DatIni, :NEW.DatIni, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouInicio := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DAT_JSON('DATINI', :NEW.DatIni, :OLD.DatIni, l_JsonAlteracao OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_DAT(:OLD.DatTer, :NEW.DatTer, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouTermino := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DAT_JSON('DATTER', :NEW.DatTer, :OLD.DatTer, l_JsonAlteracao OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.NumEmp, :NEW.NumEmp, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouResponsavel := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_NUM_JSON('NUMEMP', :NEW.NumEmp, :OLD.NumEmp, l_JsonAlteracao OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.TipCol, :NEW.TipCol, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouResponsavel := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_NUM_JSON('TIPCOL', :NEW.TipCol, :OLD.TipCol, l_JsonAlteracao OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.NumCad, :NEW.NumCad, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouResponsavel := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_NUM_JSON('NUMCAD', :NEW.NumCad, :OLD.NumCad, l_JsonAlteracao OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODFIL', :NEW.CodFil, l_Json OUT);
		
		RH_RET_DATINISST(:NEW.NumEmp, l_DatIniSST OUT);
		
		l_DataInicio := :NEW.DatIni;
		l_DataTermino := :NEW.DatTer;
		
		IF (l_DatIniSST > l_DataZero AND (l_DataTermino > l_DatIniSST OR l_DataTermino = l_DataZero)) THEN	
			IF (l_DataInicio < l_DatIniSST) THEN
				l_DataInicio := l_DatIniSST;
			END IF;
		
			IF (l_AlterouResponsavel = TRUE) THEN
				IF (:OLD.DatIni < :NEW.DatIni) THEN
					l_DataInicio := :OLD.DatIni;
				END IF;
				
				IF (:OLD.DatTer = l_DataZero OR :OLD.DatTer = l_DataZero) THEN
					l_DataTermino := l_DataZero;
				ELSE
					IF (:OLD.DatTer < :NEW.DatTer) THEN
						l_DataTermino := :OLD.DatTer;
					END IF;
				END IF;
			
				SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'A', l_DataInicio, l_DataTermino, :NEW.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, l_JsonAlteracao, 0, NULL, l_DataInicio, 0, 'R030LAU_EU');
			END IF;
			
			l_DataInicio := l_DataZero;
			l_DataTermino := l_DataZero;
			l_DataInicio2 := l_DataZero;
			l_DataTermino2 := l_DataZero;
	
			IF (l_AlterouInicio = TRUE) THEN
				SM_ALTDATINIPER(:OLD.DatIni, :NEW.DatIni, l_DataInicio OUT, l_DataTermino OUT, l_DataInicio2 OUT, l_DataTermino2 OUT);
				
				SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'A', l_DataInicio, l_DataTermino, :NEW.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, l_JsonAlteracao, 0, NULL, l_DataInicio, 0, 'R030LAU_EU');
				
				IF (l_DataInicio2 > l_DataZero) THEN
					SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'A', l_DataInicio2, l_DataTermino2, :NEW.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, l_JsonAlteracao, 0, NULL, l_DataInicio2, 0, 'R030LAU_EU');
				END IF;
			END IF;
		
			IF (l_AlterouTermino = TRUE) THEN
				SM_ALTDATTERPER(:OLD.DatTer, :NEW.DatTer, l_DataInicio OUT, l_DataTermino OUT, l_DataInicio2 OUT, l_DataTermino2 OUT);
				
				IF (l_DataInicio > l_DataZero AND l_DataInicio < l_DataMax) THEN			
					SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'A', l_DataInicio, l_DataTermino, :NEW.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, l_JsonAlteracao, 0, NULL, l_DataInicio, 0, 'R030LAU_EU');
				END IF;
				
				IF (l_DataInicio2 > l_DataZero AND l_DataInicio2 < l_DataMax) THEN
					SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'A', l_DataInicio2, l_DataTermino2, :NEW.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, l_JsonAlteracao, 0, NULL, l_DataInicio2, 0, 'R030LAU_EU');
				END IF;
			END IF;
		END IF;
	END IF;
END␀\Ò␀␀		SENIOR;0d␀␀

TRIGGER R030LAU_ED BEFORE DELETE ON R030LAU FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	l_EsocialAtivo BOOLEAN;
	l_Json VARCHAR(2000);
	l_DataZero DATE;
	l_DatIniSST DATE;
	l_DataInicio DATE;
	l_DataTermino DATE;
BEGIN
	l_DataZero := DATETIME(31, 12, 1900, 0, 0, 0);
	
	SM_ESOCIAL_ATIVO(l_EsocialAtivo OUT);
	IF (l_EsocialAtivo = TRUE) THEN
		SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODFIL', :OLD.CodFil, l_Json OUT);
		
		l_DataInicio := :OLD.DatIni ;
		l_DataTermino := :OLD.DatTer;
		
		RH_RET_DATINISST(:OLD.NumEmp, l_DatIniSST OUT);
			
		IF (l_DatIniSST > l_DataZero AND (l_DataTermino > l_DatIniSST OR l_DataTermino = l_DataZero)) THEN				
		  	IF (l_DataInicio < l_DatIniSST) THEN
				l_DataInicio := l_DatIniSST;
			END IF;
			
			SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R030LAU', 'N', 'E', l_DataInicio, l_DataTermino, :OLD.NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, '', 0, NULL, l_DataInicio, 0, 'R030LAU_ED');
		END IF;
	END IF;
