END␀␀␀‡d␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ìÜ␀␀ZÂ␀␀	„␀␀␀␀␀}Â␀␀\Â␀␀\Â␀␀\␀Èˆ␀␀ÿ␀␀õÜ␀␀␀—DÑ␀	„␀␀␀␀␀©JÙEÙEqCvˆ␀êÿ␀␀äÜ␀␀␀pw·␀	„␀␀␀␀␀jyıwıwì*␀yˆ␀Æÿ␀␀çÜ␀␀␀EÑ␀„␀␀␀␀␀}KÙEÙEqCvˆ␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀ßw·␀„␀␀␀␀␀˜yıwıwì*␀yˆ␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀©Ã␀␀±␀„␀␀␀␀␀“=àÃ␀␀àÃ␀␀q␀Æÿ␀␀ğ×␀␀␀pÁ␀␀Î␀„␀␀␀␀␀„Á␀␀~Á␀␀~Á␀␀`)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀_Á␀␀Î␀„␀␀␀␀␀•Á␀␀”Á␀␀”Á␀␀`)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀bÁ␀␀Î␀„␀␀␀␀␀Á␀␀Á␀␀Á␀␀`)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀ñ␀‹␀„␀␀␀␀␀l
␀>
␀k
␀zyˆ␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀b´␀„␀␀␀␀␀·<’aXbr␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀/␀t„␀␀␀␀␀t␀t␀t␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ˆÓ␀␀␀i$Ì␀„␀␀␀␀␀J%$€$w␀␀Æÿ␀␀…Ó␀␀␀b´␀„␀␀␀␀␀Ê<©aÉbr␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀)␀t„␀␀␀␀␀_␀-␀1␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ˆÓ␀␀␀f$Ì␀„␀␀␀␀␀c% $²$w␀␀Æÿ␀␀…Ó␀␀␀İ¬␀␀Ì␀„␀␀␀␀␀9°␀␀û␀␀û␀␀{Èˆ␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ğ³␀␀€␀„␀␀␀␀␀0´␀␀ñ³␀␀ñ³␀␀!|ˆ␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀b´␀„␀␀␀␀␀É<©aÉbr␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀&␀t„␀␀␀␀␀^␀-␀1␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀d$Ì␀„␀␀␀␀␀b% $²$w␀␀Æÿ␀␀…Ó␀␀␀—EÑ␀„␀␀␀␀␀bKÙEÙEqCvˆ␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀Úw·␀„␀␀␀␀␀”yıwıwì*␀yˆ␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀=␀Š␀„␀␀␀␀␀¯␀…␀…␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀nÁ␀␀Î␀„␀␀␀␀␀…Á␀␀Á␀␀Á␀␀`)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀oÁ␀␀Î␀„␀␀␀␀␀†Á␀␀€Á␀␀€Á␀␀`)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0;1;2íÜ␀␀		SENIOR;0¯␀␀TRIGGER R088VCS_EI AFTER INSERT ON R088VCS FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
l_OnLine          BOOLEAN;
    l_CodPrm          NUMBER(5);
    l_DatIni          DATE;
    l_HorIni          NUMBER(5);
    l_DatVal          DATE;
    l_HorVal          NUMBER(5);
    l_BloAut          VARCHAR2(1);
    l_TipPev          NUMBER(1);
    l_TipVis          NUMBER(3);
    l_NumEmp          NUMBER(4);
    l_TipCol          NUMBER(1);
    l_NumCad          NUMBER(9);
    l_Subnv           NUMBER(1);
    l_CreAcc          NUMBER(1);
    l_NumCra          NUMBER(12);
    l_TipDoc          NUMBER(1);
    l_NumDoc          VARCHAR2(20);
    l_Data_Zero       DATE;
    l_Hora_Atual      NUMBER(4);
    l_Data_Atual      DATE;
    l_SeqEnt          NUMBER(2);

    CURSOR c_R088AJD_ins IS
    SELECT TIPDOC, NUMDOC, NUMCRA
    FROM R088AJD
    WHERE PLAVEI = :NEW.PLAVEI
    AND   DATCHG = :NEW.DATCHG
    AND   HORCHG = :NEW.HORCHG;

    TYPE t_R088AJD IS RECORD(
      TIPDOC   R088AJD.TIPDOC%TYPE,
      NUMDOC   R088AJD.NUMDOC%TYPE,
      NUMCRA   R088AJD.NUMCRA%TYPE);
    l_R088AJD t_R088AJD;
BEGIN
    SP_VerOnLine(l_OnLine OUT);
    IF (l_OnLine = TRUE) THEN
        l_Data_Zero  := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
        l_Hora_Atual := HOUR(CURTIME())*60 + MINUTE(CURTIME());
        l_Data_Atual := CURDATE();

        BEGIN
            SELECT CODPRM, DATVAL, HORVAL, TIPDOC, NUMDOC
            INTO l_CodPrm, l_DatVal, l_HorVal, l_TipDoc, l_NumDoc
            FROM R088VCD A
            WHERE A.PLAVEI = :NEW.PLAVEI
            AND A.DATCHG = :NEW.DATCHG
            AND A.HORCHG = :NEW.HORCHG;
        EXCEPTION
            WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN RAISERROR 103 'R088VCS_EI: Não encontrou registro na tabela R088VCD.';
            WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R088VCS_EI: Erro No SELECT R088VCD.';
        END;

        /* Se for um histórico válido */
        IF ((l_DatVal > l_Data_Atual) OR ((l_DatVal = l_Data_Atual) AND (l_HorVal >= l_Hora_Atual)) OR
            (l_DatVal = l_Data_Zero)) THEN

            /* Bloqueia Crachá de Motorista */
            BEGIN
                SELECT NUMCRA
                INTO l_NumCra
                FROM R088VCE A
                WHERE A.PLAVEI = :NEW.PLAVEI
                AND A.DATCHG = :NEW.DATCHG
                AND A.HORCHG = :NEW.HORCHG;
            EXCEPTION
                WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN RAISERROR 103 'R088VCS_EI: Não encontrou registro na tabela R088VCE.';
                WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R088VCS_EI: Erro No SELECT R088VCE.';
            END;

            BEGIN
                SELECT DATINI, MAX(HORINI), MAX(SEQENT)
                INTO l_DatIni, l_HorIni, l_SeqEnt
                FROM R090HCH A
                WHERE A.TIPDOC = l_TipDoc
                AND A.NUMDOC = l_NumDoc
               AND A.NUMCRA=l_NumCra AND
           (A.DATINI < l_data_atual OR
            (A.DATINI = l_data_atual AND A.HORINI <= l_hora_atual)) AND
           (A.DATFIM = l_data_zero OR
            A.DATFIM > l_data_atual OR
                (A.DATFIM = l_data_atual AND A.HORFIM >= l_hora_atual)) GROUP BY DATINI;
            EXCEPTION
                WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN l_NumCra := 0;
                WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R088VCS_EI: Erro No SELECT R090HCH.';
            END;

            IF (l_NumCra > 0) THEN
                l_BloAut := '0';
                l_TipPev := 1;  /* Visitante */
                l_TipVis := 0;
                l_NumEmp := 0;
                l_TipCol := 0;
                l_NumCad := 0;
                l_Subnv  := 1;  /* Sempre inicializa a controle toda */
                l_CreAcc := 1;

                SP_VISCON(l_TipDoc, l_NumDoc, l_NumCra, l_CodPrm, l_DatIni, l_HorIni, :NEW.DATSAI, :NEW.HORSAI,
                          l_BloAut, l_TipPev, l_TipVis, l_NumEmp, l_TipCol, l_NumCad, l_Subnv, l_CreAcc, NULL);


                /* Bloqueia Crachás de Ajudantes */
                FOREACH c_R088AJD_ins INTO  l_R088AJD.TIPDOC,
                                            l_R088AJD.NUMDOC,
                                            l_R088AJD.NUMCRA
                LOOP
                    SP_VISCON(l_R088AJD.TIPDOC, l_R088AJD.NUMDOC, l_R088AJD.NUMCRA, l_CodPrm, l_DatIni, l_HorIni, :NEW.DATSAI, :NEW.HORSAI,
                              l_BloAut, l_TipPev, l_TipVis, l_NumEmp, l_TipCol, l_NumCad, l_Subnv, l_CreAcc, NULL);
                END LOOP;
            END IF;    
        END IF;
    END IF;
END␀␀␀‘ú␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀îÜ␀␀ZÂ␀␀	„␀␀␀␀␀}Â␀␀\Â␀␀\Â␀␀\␀␀␀ÿ␀␀õÜ␀␀␀œDÑ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀hINFMFqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀—␀‘␀␀␀␀␀␀␀$␀:␀9␀h)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀/U␀␀␀␀␀␀111n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀l^U␀␀␀␀␀␀ˆ^_^^^n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀/U␀␀␀␀␀␀n%␀l%␀k%␀n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀n^U␀␀␀␀␀␀^g^f^n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀³¬␀␀\␀␀␀␀␀␀+«␀␀*«␀␀)«␀␀X␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀?EÑ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÃJ†F…FqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀ÏEÑ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ùII
IqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀F␀‘␀␀␀␀␀␀␀$␀«␀¦␀h)␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀X%␀U␀␀␀␀␀␀o%␀m%␀k%␀n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀|^U␀␀␀␀␀␀^h^f^n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀W%␀U␀␀␀␀␀␀111n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀{^U␀␀␀␀␀␀‰^`^^^n␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀›Í␀␀Á␀€␀␀␀␀␀ÒÍ␀␀—␀␀¶Í␀␀yÉˆ␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0␀␀	D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ïÜ␀␀ZÂ␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀}Â␀␀\Â␀␀\Â␀␀\␀Èˆ␀␀ÿ␀␀õÜ␀␀␀…¬␀␀´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀¹b]Ç␀␀]Ç␀␀rÉˆ␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀.␀t	␀␀␀␀␀␀Ü␀t␀Ü␀n¼‡␀Æÿ␀␀ˆÓ␀␀␀c¬␀␀Ì␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀.%€$0.w¼‡␀Æÿ␀␀…Ó␀␀␀␀␀␀0;1;2;3ñÜ␀␀		SENIOR;0␀␀TRIGGER R088VEC_EI AFTER INSERT ON R088VEC FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
l_online  BOOLEAN;
    l_numcra  NUMBER(12);
    l_cravei  NUMBER(12);    
    l_datzer  DATE;
    l_datAtu  DATE;
    l_horAtu  NUMBER;
    l_datfim  DATE;    
    l_horfim  NUMBER;   
BEGIN
	l_datAtu := CURDATE();
	l_horAtu := HOUR(CURTIME())*60 + MINUTE(CURTIME());
	l_datzer := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
	l_numcra := 0;
	l_cravei := 0;
	
	l_datfim := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
	l_horfim := 0;
	
	SP_VERONLINE(l_online OUT);
	IF (l_online = TRUE) THEN
	    /* Verifica se possui histórico de crachás */
	    BEGIN
		  SP_RETCRA(2, :NEW.NUMEMP, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMCAD, 0, '', 0, '', l_numcra OUT);
		  IF(l_numcra = 0) THEN
		    SP_RETCRA(1, :NEW.NUMEMP, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMCAD, 0, '', 0, '', l_numcra OUT);
		  END IF;
		EXCEPTION
            WHEN OTHERS THEN l_numcra := 0;
		END;
		
		/* busca crachá do veículo */
	    BEGIN
		    SELECT NUMCRA INTO l_cravei FROM R088HCH
		        WHERE PLAVEI = :NEW.PLAVEI AND
                    ((DATINI < l_datAtu) OR (DATINI = l_datAtu AND HORINI <= l_horAtu)) AND
                     (DATFIM > l_datAtu OR DATFIM = l_datZer OR (DATFIM = l_datAtu AND HORFIM > l_horAtu));		    
		EXCEPTION
            WHEN OTHERS THEN l_cravei := 0;
		END;
		
		/* Se tiver crachá válido, atualiza a tabela R088CON */
		IF (l_numcra > 0) THEN
		    SP_VEIPESCON('I', l_cravei, l_numcra, 0, :NEW.PLAVEI, l_datfim, l_horfim, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMEMP, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMCAD, 0, '');		
		END IF;
	
	END IF;
END␀òÜ␀␀		SENIOR;0␀␀

TRIGGER R088VEC_EU AFTER UPDATE ON R088VEC FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
l_online  BOOLEAN;
    l_numcra  NUMBER(12);
	l_numcra_old NUMBER(12);
    l_cravei  NUMBER(12);    
	l_cravei_old  NUMBER(12);  
    l_datzer  DATE;
    l_datAtu  DATE;
    l_horAtu  NUMBER;
    l_datfim  DATE;    
    l_horfim  NUMBER;   
BEGIN
	l_datAtu := CURDATE();
	l_horAtu := HOUR(CURTIME())*60 + MINUTE(CURTIME());
	l_datzer := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
	l_numcra := 0;
	l_cravei := 0;
	l_numcra_old := 0;
	l_cravei_old := 0;
	
	l_datfim := '31/12/1900,00:00:00';
	l_horfim := 0;
	
	SP_VERONLINE(l_online OUT);
	IF (l_online = TRUE) THEN
	    /* Verifica se possui histórico de crachás */
	    BEGIN
		    SP_RETCRA(2, :NEW.NUMEMP, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMCAD, 0, '', 0, '', l_numcra OUT);
		    IF(l_numcra = 0) THEN
		      SP_RETCRA(1, :NEW.NUMEMP, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMCAD, 0, '', 0, '', l_numcra OUT);
		    END IF;
		EXCEPTION
            WHEN OTHERS THEN l_numcra := 0;
		END;

		/* busca crachá do veículo */
	    BEGIN
		    SELECT NUMCRA INTO l_cravei FROM R088HCH
		        WHERE PLAVEI = :NEW.PLAVEI AND
                    ((DATINI < l_datAtu) OR (DATINI = l_datAtu AND HORINI <= l_horAtu)) AND
                     (DATFIM > l_datAtu OR DATFIM = l_datZer OR (DATFIM = l_datAtu AND HORFIM > l_horAtu));		    
		EXCEPTION
            WHEN OTHERS THEN l_cravei := 0;
		END;

		IF (:NEW.NUMEMP <> :OLD.NUMEMP OR :NEW.TIPCOL <> :OLD.TIPCOL OR :NEW.NUMCAD <> :OLD.NUMCAD) THEN
			BEGIN
				SP_RETCRA(2, :OLD.NUMEMP, :OLD.TIPCOL, :OLD.NUMCAD, 0, '', 0, '', l_numcra_old OUT);
				IF(l_numcra_old = 0) THEN
					SP_RETCRA(1, :OLD.NUMEMP, :OLD.TIPCOL, :OLD.NUMCAD, 0, '', 0, '', l_numcra_old OUT);
				END IF;
			EXCEPTION
				WHEN OTHERS THEN l_numcra_old := 0;
			END;
		END IF;

		IF (:NEW.PLAVEI <> :OLD.PLAVEI) THEN
			BEGIN
				SELECT NUMCRA INTO l_cravei_old FROM R088HCH
				WHERE PLAVEI = :OLD.PLAVEI AND
				((DATINI < l_datAtu) OR (DATINI = l_datAtu AND HORINI <= l_horAtu)) AND
				(DATFIM > l_datAtu OR DATFIM = l_datZer OR (DATFIM = l_datAtu AND HORFIM > l_horAtu));		    
			EXCEPTION
				WHEN OTHERS THEN l_cravei_old := 0;
			END;
			IF (l_numcra_old = 0) THEN
				l_cravei_old := l_numcra;
			END IF;
		END IF;

		IF (l_numcra_old > 0 AND :NEW.PLAVEI = :OLD.PLAVEI) THEN
			l_cravei_old := l_cravei;
		END IF;

		IF (l_numcra_old > 0) THEN
	  	    SP_VEIPESCON('U', l_cravei_old, l_numcra_old, 0, :OLD.PLAVEI, l_datAtu, l_horAtu, :OLD.TIPCOL, :OLD.NUMEMP, :OLD.TIPCOL, :OLD.NUMCAD, 0, '');
		END IF;
		
		/* Se tiver crachá válido, atualiza a tabela R088CON */
		IF (l_numcra > 0) THEN
		    SP_VEIPESCON('U', l_cravei, l_numcra, 0, :NEW.PLAVEI, l_datfim, l_horfim, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMEMP, :NEW.TIPCOL, :NEW.NUMCAD, 0, '');
		END IF;
	END IF;
END␀ğÜ␀␀		SENIOR;0␀␀

