Û␀␀␀Jw·␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀xi{ÿì*␀␀Æÿ␀␀îÛ␀␀␀DÑ␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀‰L5F5FqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀1	€␀␀␀␀␀␀»␀»␀»␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀“ü␀␀±␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀´ÿ␀␀xş␀␀xş␀␀q␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀+§␀␀9€␀␀␀␀␀␀ñ©␀␀‡¨␀␀‡¨␀␀:␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀To€␀␀␀␀␀␀ŠY°V°Vi␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀ÒÒ␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀¡¡¡ÿ␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0;1;2;3;4;5;6;7␀␀õï␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀æŞ␀␀…¬␀␀´␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀‘<XbXbr␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀.␀t	€␀␀␀␀␀␀Ü␀t␀Ü␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ˆÓ␀␀␀c¬␀␀Ì␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀.%0.0.w␀Æÿ␀␀…Ó␀␀␀_DÑ␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀ãE_¦NqC␀êÿ␀␀íÛ␀␀␀Jw·␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀xi{ÿì*␀␀Æÿ␀␀îÛ␀␀␀DÑ␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀‰L5F5FqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀1	€␀␀␀␀␀␀»␀»␀»␀n␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀A␀␀Ÿ€␀␀␀␀␀␀­␀␀öŒ␀␀­␀␀n␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀ûS€␀␀␀␀␀␀‘XœV¬X7␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀ıª␀␀=€␀␀␀␀␀␀i␀␀„«␀␀™«␀␀c␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀ÉDÑ␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀ÕM"_
MqC␀␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0;1;2;3;4;5;6èŞ␀␀		SENIOR;0X␀␀TRIGGER R108NAC_AI
AFTER INSERT ON R108NAC
FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
  l_temAud BOOLEAN;
  l_codRPA NUMBER(15);
  l_codSistema NUMBER(2);
  l_codcpa NUMBER(4);
  l_codtpa NUMBER(4);
  l_datTemp VARCHAR(10);
BEGIN
  l_codSistema:= 1;
  l_codcpa := 145; 
  l_codtpa := 421; /*INCLUIR EXCLUIR */

  SP_EXISTE_LOG(l_codcpa, l_codtpa, l_codSistema, l_temAud OUT);

  IF (l_temAud = TRUE) THEN
    SP_RET_REG_AUD(l_codrpa OUT);
    SP_INS_REG_AUD(l_codrpa, l_codSistema, l_codcpa, 1, l_codtpa, 1, 'R108NAC_AI', '');

    BEGIN
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMEMP', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:NEW.NUMEMP));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPCOL', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:NEW.TIPCOL));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMCAD', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:NEW.NUMCAD));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'HORACT', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:NEW.HORACT));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPCAT', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:NEW.TIPCAT));   
      SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATACT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATACT', l_datTemp);
      SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATCAT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATCAT', l_datTemp);
     
    EXCEPTION
      WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R108NAC_AI: Erro ao inserir registros chave para a tabela de log de auditoria R995PRC.';
    END;

    BEGIN
      INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPOPE', 'Inclusão');
      INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'INDAGR',CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:NEW.INDAGR));
      INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DESAGR',:NEW.DESAGR);
      INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NOTENV',:NEW.NOTENV);
      SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATENV, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATENV', l_datTemp);
    END;
  END IF;
END␀éŞ␀␀		SENIOR;0ş␀␀

TRIGGER R108NAC_AU
AFTER UPDATE ON R108NAC
FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
  l_temAud BOOLEAN;
  l_codRPA NUMBER(15);
  l_codSistema NUMBER(2);
  l_codcpa NUMBER(4);
  l_codtpa NUMBER(4);
  l_datTemp VARCHAR(10);
BEGIN
  IF (
  :OLD.INDAGR <>:NEW.INDAGR OR
  :OLD.DESAGR <>:NEW.DESAGR OR
  :OLD.NOTENV <>:NEW.NOTENV OR
  :OLD.DATENV <>:NEW.DATENV
  ) THEN
    l_codSistema:= 1;
    l_codcpa:= 145;  /* Código da categoria de auditoria - Registro de Notificação Compulsória - Acidentes;*/
    l_codtpa:= 422;  /* Código do tipo de auditoria - Alteração*/

    SP_EXISTE_LOG(l_codcpa, l_codtpa, l_codSistema, l_temAud OUT);

    IF (l_temAud = TRUE) THEN
      SP_RET_REG_AUD(l_codrpa OUT);
      SP_INS_REG_AUD(l_codrpa, l_codSistema, l_codcpa, 1, l_codtpa, 1, 'R108NAC_AU', '');

      /* Insere os campos chave na tabela de auditoria R995PRC*/
      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMEMP', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.NUMEMP));
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPCOL', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.TIPCOL));
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMCAD', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.NUMCAD));
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'HORACT', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.HORACT));
        INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPCAT', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.TIPCAT));
	  	SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATACT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
      	INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATACT', l_datTemp);
      	SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATCAT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
      	INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATCAT', l_datTemp);
      
      EXCEPTION
        WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R108NAC_AU: Erro ao inserir registros chave para a tabela de log de auditoria R995PRC.';
      END;

      /* Insere os valores dos campos na tabela de auditoria R995PRT*/
      BEGIN
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPOPE', 'Alteração');
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDINDAGR',CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.INDAGR));
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWINDAGR',CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:NEW.INDAGR));
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDDESAGR',:OLD.DESAGR);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWDESAGR',:NEW.DESAGR);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDNOTENV',:OLD.NOTENV);
        INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWNOTENV',:NEW.NOTENV);
        SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATENV, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
	    INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'OLDDATENV', l_datTemp);
	    SP_DATSTR(:NEW.DATENV, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
	    INSERT INTO R995PRT (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NEWDATENV', l_datTemp);
        
      END;
    END IF;
  END IF;
END␀çŞ␀␀		SENIOR;0j␀␀

TRIGGER R108NAC_AD
AFTER DELETE ON R108NAC
FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
  l_temAud BOOLEAN;
  l_codRPA NUMBER(15);
  l_codSistema NUMBER(2);
  l_codcpa NUMBER(4);
  l_codtpa NUMBER(4);
  l_datTemp VARCHAR(10);
BEGIN
  l_codSistema:= 1;
  l_codcpa := 145;
  l_codtpa := 421;/*INCLUIR/EXCLUIR R108NAC*/

  SP_EXISTE_LOG(l_codcpa, l_codtpa, l_codSistema, l_temAud OUT);

  IF (l_temAud = TRUE) THEN
    SP_RET_REG_AUD(l_codrpa OUT);
    SP_INS_REG_AUD(l_codrpa, l_codSistema, l_codcpa, 1, l_codtpa, 1, 'R108NAC_AD', '');

    BEGIN
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMEMP', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.NUMEMP));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPCOL', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.TIPCOL));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'NUMCAD', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.NUMCAD));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'HORACT', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.HORACT));
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'TIPCAT', CONVERT(NUMBER_TO_CHAR,:OLD.TIPCAT)); 
      SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATACT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
      INSERT INTO R995PRC (CODRPA, NAMPPA, CONPPA) VALUES (l_codrpa, 'DATACT', l_datTemp);
      SP_DATSTR(:OLD.DATCAT, 'DD/MM/YYYY', l_datTemp OUT);
