c␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿSb´␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀¿<´b´br␀Æÿ␀␀Ò␀␀␀D-Ì␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀ì±␀␀~Æ␀␀~Æ␀␀l␀␀Æÿ␀␀1#␀␀␀␀0;1;2;38ê␀␀		SENIOR;0ó␀␀TRIGGER R583LAU_EI AFTER INSERT ON R583LAU FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	l_EmiPPPAgt   R082AGT.EmiPPP%TYPE;
	l_Json VARCHAR2(2000);
	l_DataZero DATE;
	l_DatIniRevGhe   R583REV.DatIni%TYPE;
	l_DatTerRevGhe   R583REV.DatTer%TYPE;
	l_SitEsoRevGhe   R583REV.SitEso%TYPE;
	l_NumEmp   R583FIL.NumEmp%TYPE;
	l_DatIniSST DATE;
	l_DatLau DATE;
	
	CURSOR C_EMPRESAS IS 
	SELECT DISTINCT NumEmp 
	FROM R583FIL 
	WHERE CodPRA = :NEW.CodPRA
	ORDER BY NumEmp;
BEGIN
	l_DataZero := DATETIME(31, 12, 1900, 0, 0, 0);
	
	/* Verifica se está definido no agente de risco que deve ser considerado no PPP */
	SM_RETINFAGT(:NEW.CodAgt, l_EmiPPPAgt OUT);
	
	IF (l_EmiPPPAgt <> 'N' AND :NEW.EmiPPP = 'S') THEN
		SM_RETINFREVGHE(:NEW.CodPRA, :NEW.CodGHE, :NEW.RevGHE, l_DatIniRevGhe OUT, l_DatTerRevGhe OUT, l_SitEsoRevGhe OUT);
		
		/* Gera pendência apenas se a revisão do GHE estiver com situação 1 - Ativo */
		IF (l_SitEsoRevGhe = 1) THEN
			SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODPRA', :NEW.CodPRA, l_Json OUT);
			SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODGHE', :NEW.CodGHE, l_Json OUT);
			SP_CONCATENAR_DES('REVGHE', :NEW.RevGHE, l_Json OUT);
			
		  	FOREACH C_EMPRESAS INTO l_NumEmp
		  	LOOP
		  		RH_RET_DATINISST(l_NumEmp, l_DatIniSST OUT);
		  		IF (l_DatIniSST > l_DataZero) THEN
		 			IF (l_DatTerRevGhe > l_DatIniSST OR l_DatTerRevGhe = l_DataZero) THEN
						l_DatLau := :NEW.DatLau;
						IF (l_DatLau < l_DatIniSST) THEN
	  						l_DatLau := l_DatIniSST;
	  					END IF;
	  					IF (l_DatLau < l_DatIniRevGhe) THEN
	  						l_DatLau := l_DatIniRevGhe;
	  					END IF;
						
						SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R583LAU', 'N', 'I', l_DatLau, l_DatTerRevGhe, l_NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, '', 0, NULL, l_DatLau, 0, 'R583LAU_EI');
					END IF;
				END IF;
			END LOOP;
		END IF;
	END IF;
END␀9ê␀␀		SENIOR;0ì␀␀

TRIGGER R583LAU_EU AFTER UPDATE ON R583LAU FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	l_EmiPPPAgt   R082AGT.EmiPPP%TYPE;
	l_AlterouCampo BOOLEAN;
	l_AlterouRegistro BOOLEAN;
	l_Json VARCHAR2(2000);
	l_DataZero DATE;
	l_DatIniRevGhe   R583REV.DatIni%TYPE;
	l_DatTerRevGhe   R583REV.DatTer%TYPE;
	l_SitEsoRevGhe   R583REV.SitEso%TYPE;
	l_NumEmp   R583FIL.NumEmp%TYPE;
	l_DatIniSST DATE;
	l_DatLau DATE;	
	l_JsonAlteracoes VARCHAR2(2000);
	l_SimplificacaoESocial BOOLEAN;
    l_VersaoESocial NUMBER;
    l_infoFacult BOOLEAN; 
    
	CURSOR C_EMPRESAS IS 
	SELECT DISTINCT NumEmp 
	FROM R583FIL 
	WHERE CodPRA = :NEW.CodPRA
	ORDER BY NumEmp;	
BEGIN
	l_DataZero := DATETIME(31, 12, 1900, 0, 0, 0);
	l_AlterouRegistro := FALSE;
	l_JsonAlteracoes  := '';
	
	/* Verifica se está definido no agente de risco que deve ser considerado no PPP */
	SM_RETINFAGT(:NEW.CodAgt, l_EmiPPPAgt OUT);
	
	l_SimplificacaoESocial := FALSE;
    l_VersaoESocial        := 0;
    l_InfoFacult           := FALSE;
	
	SP_ESOCIAL_INFO(:NEW.EmpPro, l_InfoFacult OUT, l_SimplificacaoESocial OUT, l_VersaoESocial OUT);
		
	IF ((l_EmiPPPAgt <> 'N') AND (:OLD.EmiPPP = 'S' OR :NEW.EmiPPP = 'S')) THEN
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.CodAna, :NEW.CodAna, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('EMIPPP', :NEW.EmiPPP, :OLD.EmiPPP, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.DesAna, :NEW.DesAna, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('DESANA', :NEW.DesAna, :OLD.DesAna, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;		
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.QuaAge, :NEW.QuaAge, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_FLO_JSON('QUAAGE', :NEW.QuaAge, :OLD.QuaAge, 0, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.QuaCol, :NEW.QuaCol, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_FLO_JSON('QUACOL', :NEW.QuaCol, :OLD.QuaCol, 0, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.QuaAte, :NEW.QuaAte, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_FLO_JSON('QUAATE', :NEW.QuaAte, :OLD.QuaAte, 0, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.TecUti, :NEW.TecUti, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_NUM_JSON('TECUTI', :NEW.TecUti, :OLD.TecUti, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);			
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.LimTol, :NEW.LimTol, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_FLO_JSON('LIMTOL', :NEW.LimTol, :OLD.LimTol, 0, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
	
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.NivAca, :NEW.NivAca, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_FLO_JSON('NIVACA', :NEW.NivAca, :OLD.NivAca, 0, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.UtiEpc, :NEW.UtiEpc, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_NUM_JSON('UTIEPC', :NEW.UtiEpc, :OLD.UtiEpc, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.EPCEfi, :NEW.EPCEfi, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('EPCEFI', :NEW.EPCEfi, :OLD.EPCEfi, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.UtiEpi, :NEW.UtiEpi, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_NUM_JSON('UTIEPI', :NEW.UtiEpi, :OLD.UtiEpi, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.ConEfi, :NEW.ConEfi, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('CONEFI', :NEW.ConEfi, :OLD.ConEfi, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.EmiPPP, :NEW.EmiPPP, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
		IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('EMIPPP', :NEW.EmiPPP, :OLD.EmiPPP, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
		
		SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.MedPro, :NEW.MedPro, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
	  	IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('MEDPRO', :NEW.MedPro, :OLD.MedPro, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
		END IF;
	  
	  	SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.ConFun, :NEW.ConFun, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
	  	IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('CONFUN', :NEW.ConFun, :OLD.ConFun, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
	  	END IF;
	  	
	  	SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.UsoIni, :NEW.UsoIni, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
	  	IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('USOINI', :NEW.UsoIni, :OLD.UsoIni, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
	  	END IF;
	  
	  	SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.PraVal, :NEW.PraVal, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
	  	IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('PRAVAL', :NEW.PraVal, :OLD.PraVal, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
	  	END IF;
	  
	  	SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.PerTro, :NEW.PerTro, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
	  	IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('PERTRO', :NEW.PerTro, :OLD.PerTro, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
	  	END IF;
	  
	  	SP_VALUPDATE_DES(:OLD.ObsHig, :NEW.ObsHig, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
	  	IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
			l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
			SP_CONCAT_DES_JSON('OBSHIG', :NEW.ObsHig, :OLD.ObsHig, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
	  	END IF;
	  	
	  	SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.VlrNen, :NEW.VlrNen, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
        IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN
        	l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;
        	SP_CONCAT_FLO_JSON('VLRNEN', :NEW.VlrNen, :OLD.VlrNen, 0, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);
        END IF;
        
        IF (l_VersaoESocial >= 6) THEN
          SP_VALUPDATE_NUM(:OLD.CodPro, :NEW.CodPro, l_AlterouCampo OUT);
          IF (l_AlterouCampo = TRUE) THEN            
            l_AlterouRegistro := TRUE;                 
            SP_CONCAT_NUM_JSON('CODPRO', :NEW.CodPro, :OLD.CodPro, l_JsonAlteracoes OUT);      
          END IF;
        END IF;

		IF (l_AlterouRegistro = TRUE) THEN
			SM_RETINFREVGHE(:NEW.CodPRA, :NEW.CodGHE, :NEW.RevGHE, l_DatIniRevGhe OUT, l_DatTerRevGhe OUT, l_SitEsoRevGhe OUT);
			
			/* Gera pendência apenas se a revisão do GHE estiver com situação 1 - Ativo */
			IF (l_SitEsoRevGhe = 1) THEN
				SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODPRA', :NEW.CodPRA, l_Json OUT);
				SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODGHE', :NEW.CodGHE, l_Json OUT);
				SP_CONCATENAR_DES('REVGHE', :NEW.RevGHE, l_Json OUT);
				
		  		FOREACH C_EMPRESAS INTO l_NumEmp
		  		LOOP
		  			RH_RET_DATINISST(l_NumEmp, l_DatIniSST OUT);
		  			IF (l_DatIniSST > l_DataZero) THEN
		 				IF (l_DatTerRevGhe > l_DatIniSST OR l_DatTerRevGhe = l_DataZero) THEN
		 					l_DatLau := :NEW.DatLau;
							IF (l_DatLau < l_DatIniSST) THEN
								l_DatLau := l_DatIniSST;
							END IF;
							IF (l_DatLau < l_DatIniRevGhe) THEN
	  							l_DatLau := l_DatIniRevGhe;
	  						END IF;
							
							SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R583LAU', 'N', 'A', l_DatLau, l_DatTerRevGhe, l_NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, l_JsonAlteracoes, 0, NULL, l_DatLau, 0, 'R583LAU_EU');
						END IF;
					END IF;
				END LOOP;
			END IF;
		END IF;
	END IF;
END␀7ê␀␀		SENIOR;0ñ␀␀

TRIGGER R583LAU_ED AFTER DELETE ON R583LAU FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	l_EmiPPPAgt   R082AGT.EmiPPP%TYPE;
	l_Json VARCHAR2(2000);
	l_DataZero DATE;
	l_DatIniRevGhe   R583REV.DatIni%TYPE;
	l_DatTerRevGhe   R583REV.DatTer%TYPE;
	l_SitEsoRevGhe   R583REV.SitEso%TYPE;
	l_NumEmp   R583FIL.NumEmp%TYPE;
	l_DatIniSST DATE;
	l_DatLau DATE;
	
	CURSOR C_EMPRESAS IS 
	SELECT DISTINCT NumEmp 
	FROM R583FIL 
	WHERE CodPRA = :OLD.CodPRA
	ORDER BY NumEmp;
BEGIN
	l_DataZero := DATETIME(31, 12, 1900, 0, 0, 0);
	
	/* Verifica se está definido no agente de risco que deve ser considerado no PPP */
	SM_RETINFAGT(:OLD.CodAgt, l_EmiPPPAgt OUT);
	
	IF (l_EmiPPPAgt <> 'N' AND :OLD.EmiPPP = 'S') THEN
		SM_RETINFREVGHE(:OLD.CodPRA, :OLD.CodGHE, :OLD.RevGHE, l_DatIniRevGhe OUT, l_DatTerRevGhe OUT, l_SitEsoRevGhe OUT);
		
		/* Gera pendência apenas se a revisão do GHE estiver com situação 1 - Ativo */
		IF (l_SitEsoRevGhe = 1) THEN
			SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODPRA', :OLD.CodPRA, l_Json OUT);
			SP_CONCATENAR_NUM('CODGHE', :OLD.CodGHE, l_Json OUT);
			SP_CONCATENAR_DES('REVGHE', :OLD.RevGHE, l_Json OUT);
		
		  	FOREACH C_EMPRESAS INTO l_NumEmp
		  	LOOP
		  		RH_RET_DATINISST(l_NumEmp, l_DatIniSST OUT);
		  		IF (l_DatIniSST > l_DataZero) THEN
		 			IF (l_DatTerRevGhe > l_DatIniSST OR l_DatTerRevGhe = l_DataZero) THEN
		 				l_DatLau := :OLD.DatLau;
						IF (l_DatLau < l_DatIniSST) THEN
							l_DatLau := l_DatIniSST;
						END IF;
						IF (l_DatLau < l_DatIniRevGhe) THEN
	  						l_DatLau := l_DatIniRevGhe;
	  					END IF;
						
						SP_E_SOCIAL_SM('S-2240', 'R583LAU', 'N', 'E', l_DatLau, l_DatTerRevGhe, l_NumEmp, 0, 0, l_Json, '', 0, NULL, l_DatLau, 0, 'R583LAU_ED');
					END IF;
				END IF;
			END LOOP;
		END IF;
	END IF;
END␀␀␀îq␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀:ê␀␀$-Ì␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ö?•¸␀␀Â;{␀Æÿ␀␀.#␀ ,Ì␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀x@áqw@{␀Æÿ␀␀##␀~ô␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀è=ô␀␀šô␀␀\␀␀␀ÿ␀␀Rì␀␀␀Ş␀´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀"?½␀␀r␀Æÿ␀␀YĞ␀␀␀§¬␀␀Ì␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀áš␀␀€š␀␀€š␀␀m␀Æÿ␀␀aĞ␀␀␀f´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀•>îe¹fr␀Æÿ␀␀)Ñ␀␀␀0,4	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀òAµ'µ'}␀␀ÿ␀␀Ñ␀␀␀␀␀␀0;1;2;3;4;5;6␀␀õq␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;ê␀␀$-Ì␀	Ôÿ/␀␀␀␀␀ö?•¸␀␀Â;{␀Æÿ␀␀.#␀ ,Ì␀	Ôÿ/␀␀␀␀␀x@áqw@{␀Æÿ␀␀##␀~ô␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀è=ô␀␀šô␀␀\␀␀␀ÿ␀␀Rì␀␀␀ş,Á␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀S=¤:¤:y␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀ú+¼␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀AX¿␀␀X¿␀␀v␀Æÿ␀␀#␀␀␀␀	0;1;2;4;3␀␀òq␀␀␀␀␀␀<ê␀␀ş,Á␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀S=¤:¤:y␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀äT€␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀ÉW°V°Vw␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ÿ³␀␀d€␀␀␀␀␀␀-´␀␀ñ³␀␀ñ³␀␀_␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀µ,Á␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀zAÕ␀Õ␀y␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀=ê␀␀$-Ì␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀ö?•¸␀␀Â;{␀Æÿ␀␀.#␀ ,Ì␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀x@áqw@{␀Æÿ␀␀##␀~ô␀␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀è=ô␀␀šô␀␀\␀␀␀ÿ␀␀Rì␀␀␀ú+¼␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀AX¿␀␀X¿␀␀v␀Æÿ␀␀#␀&EÑ␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀°IÙEHqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀¤w·␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀zZ”␀␀dxì*␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀ïw·␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀¼y6␀ßxì*␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀WË␀␀”␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀gÍ␀␀OÍ␀␀SÍ␀␀^␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀XË␀␀”␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀mÍ␀␀®Ë␀␀PÍ␀␀^␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀ZË␀␀”␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀pÍ␀␀¯Ë␀␀UÍ␀␀^␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀-±␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀TB±®␀␀±®␀␀q␀Æÿ␀␀²Û␀␀␀Ÿ³␀␀*€␀␀␀␀␀␀.´␀␀ñ³␀␀ñ³␀␀=␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀8\€␀␀␀␀␀␀Æ8Æ8Æ8n␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ0␀␀␀0;1;2;3;4;5␀␀óq␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀>ê␀␀$-Ì␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀ö?•¸␀␀Â;{␀Æÿ␀␀.#␀ ,Ì␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀x@áqw@{␀Æÿ␀␀##␀~ô␀␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀è=ô␀␀šô␀␀\␀␀␀ÿ␀␀Rì␀␀␀ú+¼␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀AX¿␀␀X¿␀␀v␀Æÿ␀␀#␀-±␀	€␀␀␀␀␀␀Ä␀␀Ä␀␀Ä␀