zí*␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀mDÑ␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿrJlJlJqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀Tw·␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ\y[y[yí*␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀´DÑ␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿïMÛMÛMqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀zw·␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿzzzí*␀␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀£÷␀␀¢␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ£ÿ␀␀xş␀␀£ÿ␀␀†)␀␀	Æÿ␀␀£÷␀␀␀␀␀␀0Aë␀␀		SENIOR;0Ú␀␀TRIGGER R910USU_EI BEFORE INSERT ON R910USU FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
l_verseq     NUMBER(10);
  l_seqreg     NUMBER(15);
  l_veraud     CHAR(1);
BEGIN
  /* INICIO CONTROLE DE AUDITORIA DE REGISTROS*/
  l_veraud := 'N';
  SP_AUDVER(l_veraud OUT,'R910USU');

  IF (l_veraud = 'S') THEN
      SP_AUDGETVERSEQ(0,l_seqreg OUT, l_verseq OUT);
      :NEW.SEQREG := l_seqreg;
      BEGIN
          INSERT INTO R910AUS (SEQREG, VERSEQ, CODENT, NOMCOM, DESUSU, ALTSEN, CONHAB, CONBLO, DATBLO,
                               HORBLO, DATSEN, HORSEN, POLDSE, POLSAN, POLBLQ, DATCRE,
                               DATLOG, HORLOG, DATALT, HORALT, DATDES, HORDES)
                       VALUES (l_seqreg,l_verseq,:NEW.CODENT,:NEW.NOMCOM,:NEW.DESUSU,:NEW.ALTSEN,:NEW.CONHAB,:NEW.CONBLO,:NEW.DATBLO,
                               :NEW.HORBLO,:NEW.DATSEN,:NEW.HORSEN,:NEW.POLDSE,:NEW.POLSAN,:NEW.POLBLQ,:NEW.DATCRE,
                               :NEW.DATLOG,:NEW.HORLOG,:NEW.DATALT,:NEW.HORALT,:NEW.DATDES,:NEW.HORDES);

          SP_AUDGENREG(l_seqreg,l_verseq,'R910USU','INSERÇÃO');
      EXCEPTION
          WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R910USU_EI. Erro gerar registro para auditoria ';
      END;
  END IF;/*FIM DO CONTROLE DE AUDITORIA DE REGISTRO*/
END␀Bë␀␀		SENIOR;0␀␀

TRIGGER R910USU_EU AFTER UPDATE ON R910USU FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
l_alterou          BOOLEAN;
  l_camposAlterados  VARCHAR(2000);
  l_verseq           NUMBER(10);
  l_seqreg           NUMBER(15);
  l_veraud           CHAR(1);
BEGIN
  /* INICIO CONTROLE DE AUDITORIA DE REGISTROS*/
  l_veraud := 'N';
  SP_AUDVER(l_veraud OUT,'R910USU');

  IF (l_veraud = 'S') THEN
      l_camposAlterados := 'Campo(s) alterado(s): ';
      l_alterou := FALSE;

      IF (:NEW.CODENT <> :OLD.CODENT) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'CODENT ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.NOMCOM <> :OLD.NOMCOM) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'NOMCOM ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.DESUSU <> :OLD.DESUSU) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'DESUSU ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.ALTSEN <> :OLD.ALTSEN) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'ALTSEN ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.CONHAB <> :OLD.CONHAB) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'CONHAB ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.CONBLO <> :OLD.CONBLO) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'CONBLO ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.DATBLO <> :OLD.DATBLO) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'DATBLO ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.HORBLO <> :OLD.HORBLO) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'HORBLO ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.DATSEN <> :OLD.DATSEN) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'DATSEN ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.HORSEN <> :OLD.HORSEN) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'HORSEN ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.POLDSE <> :OLD.POLDSE) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'POLDSE ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.POLSAN <> :OLD.POLSAN) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'POLSAN ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.POLBLQ <> :OLD.POLBLQ) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'POLBLQ ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.DATCRE <> :OLD.DATCRE) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'DATCRE ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.DATLOG <> :OLD.DATLOG) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'DATLOG ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.HORLOG <> :OLD.HORLOG) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'HORLOG ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.DATALT <> :OLD.DATALT) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'DATALT ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.HORALT <> :OLD.HORALT) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'HORALT ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.DATDES <> :OLD.DATDES) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'DATDES ';
      END IF;

      IF (:NEW.HORDES <> :OLD.HORDES) THEN
          l_alterou := TRUE;
          l_camposAlterados := l_camposAlterados||'HORDES ';
      END IF;


      IF (l_alterou = TRUE) THEN

          l_camposAlterados := 'ALTERAÇÃO - '||l_camposAlterados;

          l_seqreg := :NEW.SEQREG;

          IF ((:NEW.SEQREG IS NULL) OR (:NEW.SEQREG < 1)) THEN

              BEGIN
                  SELECT MAX(SEQREG) INTO l_seqreg FROM R910AUS WHERE CODENT = :OLD.CODENT;
              EXCEPTION
                  WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R910USU_EU. Erro ao selecionar a sequência do registro. ';
              END;
          END IF;

          SP_AUDGETVERSEQ(l_seqreg,l_seqreg OUT, l_verseq OUT);

          BEGIN
              INSERT INTO R910AUS (SEQREG,VERSEQ,CODENT,NOMCOM,DESUSU,ALTSEN,CONHAB,CONBLO,DATBLO,
                                   HORBLO,DATSEN,HORSEN,POLDSE,POLSAN,POLBLQ,DATCRE,
                                   DATLOG,HORLOG,DATALT,HORALT,DATDES,HORDES)
                          VALUES (l_seqreg,l_verseq,:NEW.CODENT,:NEW.NOMCOM,:NEW.DESUSU,:NEW.ALTSEN,:NEW.CONHAB,:NEW.CONBLO,:NEW.DATBLO,
                                  :NEW.HORBLO,:NEW.DATSEN,:NEW.HORSEN,:NEW.POLDSE,:NEW.POLSAN,:NEW.POLBLQ,:NEW.DATCRE,
                                  :NEW.DATLOG,:NEW.HORLOG,:NEW.DATALT,:NEW.HORALT,:NEW.DATDES,:NEW.HORDES);


              SP_AUDGENREG(l_seqreg,l_verseq,'R910USU',l_camposAlterados);
          EXCEPTION
              WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R910USU_EU. Erro gerar registro para auditoria. ';
          END;
      END IF;
  END IF; /*FIM DO CONTROLE DE AUDITORIA DE REGISTRO*/
END␀@ë␀␀		SENIOR;0␀␀

TRIGGER R910USU_ED AFTER DELETE ON R910USU FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
l_verseq     NUMBER(10);
  l_seqreg     NUMBER(15);
  l_veraud     CHAR(1);
BEGIN
  /* INICIO CONTROLE DE AUDITORIA DE REGISTROS*/
  l_veraud := 'N';
  SP_AUDVER(l_veraud OUT,'R910USU');

  IF (l_veraud = 'S') THEN
      l_seqreg := :OLD.SEQREG;

      IF ((:OLD.SEQREG IS NULL) OR (:OLD.SEQREG < 1)) THEN
          BEGIN
              SELECT MAX(SEQREG) INTO l_seqreg FROM R910AUS WHERE CODENT = :OLD.CODENT;
          EXCEPTION
              WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R910USU_ED. Erro ao selecionar a sequência do registro. ';
          END;
      END IF;
      SP_AUDGETVERSEQ(l_seqreg,l_seqreg OUT, l_verseq OUT);

      BEGIN
          INSERT INTO R910AUS(SEQREG,VERSEQ,CODENT,NOMCOM,DESUSU,ALTSEN,CONHAB,CONBLO,DATBLO,
                               HORBLO,DATSEN,HORSEN,POLDSE,POLSAN,POLBLQ,DATCRE,
                               DATLOG,HORLOG,DATALT,HORALT,DATDES,HORDES)
                       VALUES (l_seqreg,l_verseq,:OLD.CODENT,:OLD.NOMCOM,:OLD.DESUSU,:OLD.ALTSEN,:OLD.CONHAB,:OLD.CONBLO,:OLD.DATBLO,
                               :OLD.HORBLO,:OLD.DATSEN,:OLD.HORSEN,:OLD.POLDSE,:OLD.POLSAN,:OLD.POLBLQ,:OLD.DATCRE,
                               :OLD.DATLOG,:OLD.HORLOG,:OLD.DATALT,:OLD.HORALT,:OLD.DATDES,:OLD.HORDES);

          SP_AUDGENREG(l_seqreg,l_verseq,'R910USU','DELETE');
      EXCEPTION
          WHEN OTHERS THEN RAISERROR 103 'R910USU_ED. Erro gerar registro para auditoria. ';
      END;
  END IF;/*FIM DO CONTROLE DE AUDITORIA DE REGISTRO*/
