␀␀PROCEDURE SM_RETINFLAU(p_CodPRA NUMBER(9), p_CodGHE NUMBER(9), p_RevGHE VARCHAR(11), p_CodAgt NUMBER(6), p_EmiPPP OUT CHAR)
 IS

