0 HORFIM,
R016HIE.TABORG TABORG, 
R016HIE.NUMLOC NUMLOC,
R016HIE.CODLOC CODLOC,
R016HIE.POSLOC POSLOC,
CONTOV,
CONTOS
FROM R038HLO,R016HIE
WHERE
DATALT = (SELECT MAX(DATALT) FROM R038HLO A 
WHERE 
R038HLO.NUMEMP = A.NUMEMP AND R038HLO.TIPCOL = A.TIPCOL AND
R038HLO.NUMCAD = A.NUMCAD) AND 
R016HIE.TABORG = R038HLO.TABORG  AND
R016HIE.NUMLOC = R038HLO.NUMLOC  AND 
R016HIE.DATINI <= R038HLO.DATALT AND
R016HIE.DATFIM >= R038HLO.DATALT
))␀ÿ»␀ó¥␀␀´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀‘<XbXbr␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀(␀´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀>½␀␀r␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀ù¥␀␀Ì␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ôš␀␀€š␀␀€š␀␀m␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀c`´␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀÷<ïe»fr␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀#4	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿ?µ'µ'}␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀"Ñ␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;MÙEÙEqC␀êÿ␀␀ÿ␀r␀­␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀³B␀␀pM‡␀Æÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀7	␀␀ SELECT 
