‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀j—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀k—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀l—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀m—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀n—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀o—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀p—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀q—␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y°V°Vi‡␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀sH␀␀ SELECT R030EMP.NUMEMP,R030EMP.APEEMP, 
                CASE R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                  WHEN 1 THEN 'EMPREGADO' 
                  WHEN 2 THEN 'PARCEIRO' 
                  WHEN 3 THEN 'TERCEIRO' 
                END TIPCOL, 
                  R034FUN.NUMCAD,R034FUN.NOMFUN,R038HCA.DATALT,R024CAR.TITCAR,R048DCC.DATLCT,R044CAL.TIPCAL,R044CAL.PERREF, 
                CASE R048DCC.TIPCTB 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CÁLCULO DA FOLHA' 
                  WHEN 'F' THEN 'FÉRIAS' 
                  WHEN 'R' THEN 'RESCISÃO' 
                END TIPCTB, 
                  R048DCC.TABEVE,R048DCC.CODCLC,R048CLC.NOMCON,R020RAT.DESRAT,R020RAT1.DESRAT RATPAD,R018CCU.CODCCU, 
                  R018CCU.NOMCCU,R048DCC.HISPAD, 
                CASE R048DCC.DEBCRE 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CRÉDITO' 
                  WHEN 'D' THEN 'DÉBITO' 
                END DEBCRE, 
                  R048DCC.VALCLC,R030FIL.CODFIL,R030FIL.NOMFIL,R174CND.NATDES,R174CND.CODCON,R174CND.CODRED, 
                   ' ' LOCNV1,' ' LOCNV2,' ' LOCNV3,' ' LOCNV4,' ' LOCNV5,' ' LOCNV6,' ' LOCNV7,' ' LOCNV8, 
                   ' ' LOCNV9,' ' LOCNVA,' ' LOCNVB,' ' LOCNVC,' ' LOCNVD,' ' LOCNVE,' ' LOCNVF,' ' LOCNVG,
                   ' ' LOCNVH,' ' LOCNVI,' ' LOCNVJ,' ' LOCNVK,' ' LOCNVL,' ' LOCNVM,' ' LOCNVN,' ' LOCNVO 
                FROM R034FUN,R048DCC,R044CAL,R048CLC,R030FIL,R020RAT,R020RAT R020RAT1,R018CCU,R174CND,R048DEF,R038HCA,R024CAR,R030EMP 
               WHERE R034FUN.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R048DCC.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R048DCC.NUMCAD 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R038HCA.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R038HCA.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R038HCA.NUMCAD 
                AND R024CAR.ESTCAR = R038HCA.ESTCAR 
                AND R024CAR.CODCAR = R038HCA.CODCAR 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R030EMP.NUMEMP 
                AND R044CAL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R044CAL.CODCAL = R048DCC.CODCAL 
                AND R048CLC.TABEVE = R048DCC.TABEVE 
                AND R048CLC.CODCLC = R048DCC.CODCLC 
                AND R030FIL.CODFIL = R048DCC.CODFIL 
                AND R030FIL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R048DCC.CODRAT = R020RAT.CODRAT (+) 
                AND R048DCC.RATPAD = R020RAT1.CODRAT (+) 
                AND R018CCU.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R018CCU.CODCCU = R048DCC.CODCCU 
                AND ((R018CCU.TIPCTA = 'P' AND R018CCU.NUMEMP = R174CND.NUMEMP 
                   AND R018CCU.CODCCU = R174CND.CODCCU) OR (R018CCU.TIPCTA = 'O' 
                   AND R018CCU.OUTEMP = R174CND.NUMEMP AND R018CCU.OUTCCU = R174CND.CODCCU)) 
                AND R048DCC.TABEVE = R174CND.TABEVE 
                AND R048DCC.CODCLC = R174CND.CODCLC 
                AND ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                        WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                         AND USANAT = 'S') 
                    OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'S') 
                    AND (R174CND.NATDES = (SELECT NATDES FROM R038HNA 
                                WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                 AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                 AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD 
                                 AND R038HNA.DATALT = (SELECT MAX(DATALT) FROM R038HNA 
                                            WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                             AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                             AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD))) 
                    OR ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                           WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                            AND USANAT = 'N') 
                       OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'N') 
                    AND R174CND.NATDES = 0)) 
                AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R172DCO 
                         WHERE R048DCC.NUMEMP = R172DCO.NUMEMP 
                          AND R048DCC.NUMCAD = R172DCO.NUMCAD 
                          AND R048DCC.TIPCOL = R172DCO.TIPCOL) 
               UNION 
               SELECT R030EMP.NUMEMP,R030EMP.APEEMP,
                CASE R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                  WHEN 1 THEN 'EMPREGADO' 
                  WHEN 2 THEN 'PARCEIRO' 
                  WHEN 3 THEN 'TERCEIRO' 
                END TIPCOL,
                  R034FUN.NUMCAD,R034FUN.NOMFUN,R038HCA.DATALT,R024CAR.TITCAR,R048DCC.DATLCT,R044CAL.TIPCAL,R044CAL.PERREF,
                CASE R048DCC.TIPCTB 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CÁLCULO DA FOLHA' 
                  WHEN 'F' THEN 'FÉRIAS' 
                  WHEN 'R' THEN 'RESCISÃO' 
                END,
                  R048DCC.TABEVE,R048DCC.CODCLC,R048CLC.NOMCON,R020RAT.DESRAT,R020RAT1.DESRAT RATPAD,' ' CODCCU,' ' NOMCCU,R048DCC.HISPAD,
                CASE R048DCC.DEBCRE 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CRÉDITO' 
                  WHEN 'D' THEN 'DÉBITO' 
                END, 
                  R048DCC.VALCLC,R030FIL.CODFIL,R030FIL.NOMFIL,R178CND.NATDES,R178CND.CODCON,R178CND.CODRED,
                   ' ' LOCNV1,' ' LOCNV2,' ' LOCNV3,' ' LOCNV4,' ' LOCNV5,' ' LOCNV6,' ' LOCNV7,' ' LOCNV8, 
                   ' ' LOCNV9,' ' LOCNVA,' ' LOCNVB,' ' LOCNVC,' ' LOCNVD,' ' LOCNVE,' ' LOCNVF,' ' LOCNVG,
                   ' ' LOCNVH,' ' LOCNVI,' ' LOCNVJ,' ' LOCNVK,' ' LOCNVL,' ' LOCNVM,' ' LOCNVN,' ' LOCNVO 
                FROM R034FUN,R048DCC,R044CAL,R048CLC,R030FIL,R020RAT,R020RAT R020RAT1,R178DTO,R178CND,R048DEF,R038HCA,R024CAR,R030EMP 
               WHERE R034FUN.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R048DCC.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R048DCC.NUMCAD 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R038HCA.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R038HCA.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R038HCA.NUMCAD 
                AND R024CAR.ESTCAR = R038HCA.ESTCAR 
                AND R024CAR.CODCAR = R038HCA.CODCAR 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R030EMP.NUMEMP 
                AND R044CAL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R048CLC.NIVLAN = 'T' 
                AND R030EMP.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R044CAL.CODCAL = R048DCC.CODCAL 
                AND R048CLC.TABEVE = R048DCC.TABEVE 
                AND R048CLC.CODCLC = R048DCC.CODCLC 
                AND R030FIL.CODFIL = R048DCC.CODFIL 
                AND R030FIL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R048DCC.CODRAT = R020RAT.CODRAT (+) 
                AND R048DCC.RATPAD = R020RAT1.CODRAT (+) 
                AND ((R030EMP.TOTCTB = 'E' 
                   AND R178DTO.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                   AND R178DTO.FILCTB = (SELECT MIN (R178DTO.FILCTB) FROM R178DTO 
                               WHERE R178DTO.NUMEMP=R048DCC.NUMEMP)) 
                   OR (R030EMP.TOTCTB = 'F' 
                   AND R178DTO.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                   AND R178DTO.FILCTB= R030FIL.FILCTB)) 
                AND ((R178DTO.TIPCTA = 'P' 
                   AND R178DTO.NUMEMP = R178CND.NUMEMP 
                   AND R178DTO.FILCTB = R178CND.FILCTB) 
                   OR (R178DTO.TIPCTA = 'O' 
                   AND R178DTO.OUTEMP = R178CND.NUMEMP 
                   AND R178DTO.OUTFIL = R178CND.FILCTB)) 
                AND R048DCC.TABEVE = R178CND.TABEVE 
                AND R048DCC.CODCLC = R178CND.CODCLC 
                AND ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                        WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                         AND USANAT = 'S') 
                   OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'S') 
                   AND (R178CND.NATDES = (SELECT NATDES FROM R038HNA 
                               WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD 
                                AND R038HNA.DATALT = (SELECT MAX(DATALT) FROM R038HNA 
                                            WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                             AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                             AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD))) 
                   OR ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                          WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                           AND USANAT = 'N') 
                      OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'N') 
                      AND R178CND.NATDES = 0)) 
               UNION 
               SELECT R030EMP.NUMEMP,R030EMP.APEEMP,
                CASE R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                  WHEN 1 THEN 'EMPREGADO' 
                  WHEN 2 THEN 'PARCEIRO' 
                  WHEN 3 THEN 'TERCEIRO' 
                END TIPCOL, 
                  R034FUN.NUMCAD,R034FUN.NOMFUN,R038HCA.DATALT,R024CAR.TITCAR,R048DCC.DATLCT,R044CAL.TIPCAL,R044CAL.PERREF,
                CASE R048DCC.TIPCTB 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CÁLCULO DA FOLHA' 
                  WHEN 'F' THEN 'FÉRIAS' 
                  WHEN 'R' THEN 'RESCISÃO' 
                END, 
                  R048DCC.TABEVE,R048DCC.CODCLC,R048CLC.NOMCON,R020RAT.DESRAT,R020RAT1.DESRAT RATPAD,' ' CODCCU,' ' NOMCCU,R048DCC.HISPAD,
                CASE R048DCC.DEBCRE 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CRÉDITO' 
                  WHEN 'D' THEN 'DÉBITO' 
                END, 
                  R048DCC.VALCLC,R030FIL.CODFIL,R030FIL.NOMFIL,R172CND.NATDES,R172CND.CODCON,R172CND.CODRED, 
                   ' ' LOCNV1,' ' LOCNV2,' ' LOCNV3,' ' LOCNV4,' ' LOCNV5,' ' LOCNV6,' ' LOCNV7,' ' LOCNV8, 
                   ' ' LOCNV9,' ' LOCNVA,' ' LOCNVB,' ' LOCNVC,' ' LOCNVD,' ' LOCNVE,' ' LOCNVF,' ' LOCNVG,
                   ' ' LOCNVH,' ' LOCNVI,' ' LOCNVJ,' ' LOCNVK,' ' LOCNVL,' ' LOCNVM,' ' LOCNVN,' ' LOCNVO 
                FROM R034FUN,R048DCC,R044CAL,R048CLC,R030FIL,R020RAT,R020RAT R020RAT1,R172CND,R048DEF,R038HCA,R024CAR,R030EMP 
               WHERE R034FUN.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R048DCC.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R048DCC.NUMCAD 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R038HCA.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R038HCA.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R038HCA.NUMCAD 
                AND R024CAR.ESTCAR = R038HCA.ESTCAR 
                AND R024CAR.CODCAR = R038HCA.CODCAR 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R030EMP.NUMEMP 
                AND R044CAL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R048CLC.NIVLAN = 'T' 
                AND R030EMP.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R044CAL.CODCAL = R048DCC.CODCAL 
                AND R048CLC.TABEVE = R048DCC.TABEVE 
                AND R048CLC.CODCLC = R048DCC.CODCLC 
                AND R030FIL.CODFIL = R048DCC.CODFIL 
                AND R030FIL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R048DCC.CODRAT = R020RAT.CODRAT (+) 
                AND R048DCC.RATPAD = R020RAT1.CODRAT (+) 
                AND R172CND.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R172CND.TIPCOL = R048DCC.TIPCOL 
                AND R172CND.NUMCAD = R048DCC.NUMCAD 
                AND R172CND.TIPCOL = R048DCC.TABEVE 
                AND R172CND.CODCLC = R048DCC.CODCLC 
                AND ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                        WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                         AND USANAT = 'S') 
                         OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'S') 
                   AND (R172CND.NATDES = (SELECT NATDES FROM R038HNA 
                               WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD 
                                AND R038HNA.DATALT = (SELECT MAX(DATALT) FROM R038HNA 
                                            WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                             AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                             AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD))) 
                   OR ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                          WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                           AND USANAT = 'N') 
                      OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'N') 
                      AND R172CND.NATDES = 0)) 
               UNION 
               SELECT R030EMP.NUMEMP, R030EMP.APEEMP,
                CASE R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                  WHEN 1 THEN 'EMPREGADO' 
                  WHEN 2 THEN 'PARCEIRO' 
                  WHEN 3 THEN 'TERCEIRO' 
                END TIPCOL, 
                  R034FUN.NUMCAD,R034FUN.NOMFUN,R038HCA.DATALT,R024CAR.TITCAR,R048DCC.DATLCT,R044CAL.TIPCAL,R044CAL.PERREF,
                CASE R048DCC.TIPCTB 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CÁLCULO DA FOLHA' 
                  WHEN 'F' THEN 'FÉRIAS' 
                  WHEN 'R' THEN 'RESCISÃO' 
                END,
                  R048DCC.TABEVE,R048DCC.CODCLC,R048CLC.NOMCON,R020RAT.DESRAT,R020RAT1.DESRAT RATPAD,' ' CODCCU,' ' NOMCCU,R048DCC.HISPAD, 
                CASE R048DCC.DEBCRE 
                  WHEN 'C' THEN 'CRÉDITO' 
                  WHEN 'D' THEN 'DÉBITO' 
                END, 
                  R048DCC.VALCLC,R030FIL.CODFIL,R030FIL.NOMFIL,R176CND.NATDES,R176CND.CODCON,R176CND.CODRED,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV1,
                  VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV2,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV3,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV4,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV5,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV6,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV7,
                  VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV8,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNV9,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVA,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVB,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVC,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVD,
                  VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVE,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVF,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVG,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVH,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVI,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVJ,
                  VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVK,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVL,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVM,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVN,VBI_LOCTODNVL.NOMNVO 
                FROM R034FUN,R048DCC,R044CAL,R048CLC,R030FIL,R020RAT,R020RAT R020RAT1,R176DLO,R176CND,R048DEF,R038HCA,R024CAR,R030EMP,VBI_LOCTODNVL 
               WHERE R034FUN.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R048DCC.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R048DCC.NUMCAD 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R038HCA.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R038HCA.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R038HCA.NUMCAD 
                AND R024CAR.ESTCAR = R038HCA.ESTCAR 
                AND R024CAR.CODCAR = R038HCA.CODCAR 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R030EMP.NUMEMP 
                AND VBI_LOCTODNVL.TABORG = R048DCC.TABORG 
                AND R048DCC.NUMLOC = VBI_LOCTODNVL.NUMLOC 
                AND R044CAL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R044CAL.CODCAL = R048DCC.CODCAL 
                AND R048CLC.TABEVE = R048DCC.TABEVE 
                AND R048CLC.CODCLC = R048DCC.CODCLC 
                AND R030FIL.CODFIL = R048DCC.CODFIL 
                AND R030FIL.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                AND R048DCC.CODRAT = R020RAT.CODRAT 
                AND R048DCC.RATPAD = R020RAT1.CODRAT 
                AND R048DCC.NUMEMP = R176DLO.NUMEMP 
                AND R048DCC.TABORG = R176DLO.TABORG 
                AND R048DCC.NUMLOC = R176DLO.NUMLOC 
                AND R048DCC.TABEVE = R176CND.TABEVE 
                AND R048DCC.CODCLC = R176CND.CODCLC 
                AND ((R176DLO.TIPCTA = 'P' 
                   AND R176DLO.NUMEMP = R176CND.NUMEMP 
                   AND R176DLO.TABORG = R176CND.TABORG 
                   AND R176DLO.NUMLOC = R176CND.NUMLOC) 
                   OR (R176DLO.TIPCTA = 'O' 
                     AND R176DLO.OUTEMP = R176CND.NUMEMP 
                     AND R176DLO.OUTTAB = R176CND.TABORG 
                     AND R176DLO.OUTLOC = R176CND.NUMLOC)) 
                AND ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                        WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                         AND USANAT = 'S') 
                   OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'S') 
                   AND (R176CND.NATDES = (SELECT NATDES FROM R038HNA 
                               WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD 
                                AND R038HNA.DATALT = (SELECT MAX(DATALT) FROM R038HNA 
                                            WHERE NUMEMP = R034FUN.NUMEMP 
                                             AND R038HNA.TIPCOL = R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                                             AND R038HNA.NUMCAD = R034FUN.NUMCAD))) 
                   OR ((EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DEE 
                          WHERE NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                          AND USANAT = 'N') 
                   OR R048DEF.USANAT = 'N') 
                   AND R176CND.NATDES = 0))
               UNION 
               SELECT R030EMP.NUMEMP,R030EMP.APEEMP,
                CASE R034FUN.TIPCOL 
                  WHEN 1 THEN 'EMPREGADO' 
                  WHEN 2 THEN 'PARCEIRO' 
                  WHEN 3 THEN 'TERCEIRO' 
                END TIPCOL, 
                  R034FUN.NUMCAD,R034FUN.NOMFUN,R038HCA.DATALT,R024CAR.TITCAR,DAY(1900,12,31) DATLCT,0 TIPCAL, R038HCA.DATALT PERREF,
                  ' ' TIPCTB, 0 TABEVE, 0 CODCLC,' ' NOMCON,' ' DESRAT,' ' RATPAD,' ' CODCCU,' ' NOMCCU, 0 HISPAD, 
                  ' ' DEBCRE, 0 VALCLC, 0 CODFIL, ' ' NOMFIL, 0 NATDES, ' ' CODCON, 0 CODRED,' ' LOCNV1,' ' LOCNV2,
                  ' ' LOCNV3,' ' LOCNV4,' ' LOCNV5,' ' LOCNV6,' ' LOCNV7,' ' LOCNV8,' ' LOCNV9,' ' LOCNVA,
                  ' ' LOCNVB,' ' LOCNVC,' ' LOCNVD,' ' LOCNVE,' ' LOCNVF,' ' LOCNVG,' ' LOCNVH,' ' LOCNVI,
                  ' ' LOCNVJ,' ' LOCNVK,' ' LOCNVL,' ' LOCNVM,' ' LOCNVN,' ' LOCNVO
                FROM R034FUN,R038HCA,R024CAR,R030EMP 
               WHERE R034FUN.NUMEMP = R038HCA.NUMEMP 
                AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R038HCA.TIPCOL 
                AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R038HCA.NUMCAD 
                AND R024CAR.ESTCAR = R038HCA.ESTCAR 
                AND R024CAR.CODCAR = R038HCA.CODCAR 
                AND R034FUN.NUMEMP = R030EMP.NUMEMP 
                AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM R048DCC 
                         WHERE R034FUN.NUMEMP = R048DCC.NUMEMP 
                          AND R034FUN.NUMCAD = R048DCC.NUMCAD 
                          AND R034FUN.TIPCOL = R048DCC.TIPCOL)VBI_LOCTODNVL
